{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: Agent基础概念MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent 的记忆系统面临哪些工程挑战？如何设计分层记忆架构？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent基础概念\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> advanced\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/基础概念\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/advanced</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">在生产环境中，Agent 的记忆系统面临哪些工程挑战？如何设计一个高性能、可扩展的分层记忆架构？请详细描述记忆的编码、存储、检索、巩固、遗忘的全生命周期管理。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"1. 答案\" dir=\"auto\">1. 答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>记忆系统的核心工程挑战：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>容量与成本的平衡</strong>：记忆太多消耗 Token/存储，太少则丢失关键信息</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>检索准确率</strong>：从大量记忆中找到最相关的片段</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>一致性</strong>：多轮对话中记忆的一致性维护</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>隐私与安全</strong>：用户敏感信息的存储和访问控制</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>冷启动</strong>：新用户没有历史记忆时的体验</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>多模态记忆</strong>：文本、图片、音频等多种形态的记忆</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>分层记忆架构设计：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                     四层记忆架构                                  │\n├─────────────┬─────────────┬─────────────┬───────────────────────┤\n│   L1 工作记忆 │  L2 短期记忆  │  L3 长期记忆   │   L4 认知记忆          │\n│  (上下文窗口) │  (会话缓存)   │  (向量数据库)  │   (知识图谱)           │\n├─────────────┼─────────────┼─────────────┼───────────────────────┤\n│ 当前推理上下文│ 对话历史摘要  │ 用户画像偏好  │ 领域知识结构           │\n│ 任务进度追踪  │ 中间结果缓存  │ 历史经验沉淀  │ 实体关系网络           │\n│ 热数据(&lt;1s)  │ 温数据(&lt;1h)  │ 冷数据(永久)  │ 结构化知识(永久)       │\n│ 内存         │ Redis        │ 向量DB + SQL  │ 图数据库              │\n└─────────────┴─────────────┴─────────────┴───────────────────────┘\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>记忆全生命周期管理：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">MemoryLifecycleManager</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"记忆全生命周期管理器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>working_memory <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> WorkingMemory<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>      <span class=\"token comment\"># L1</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>short_term <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ShortTermMemoryStore<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>    <span class=\"token comment\"># L2 (Redis)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>long_term <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> LongTermMemoryStore<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>      <span class=\"token comment\"># L3 (向量DB)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>cognitive <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> CognitiveMemoryStore<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>     <span class=\"token comment\"># L4 (图数据库)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># ===== 1. 编码 (Encode) =====</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">encode</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> raw_interaction<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Interaction<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> MemoryEntry<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"将原始交互转化为结构化记忆\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 使用 LLM 提取关键信息</span>\n        extraction_prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"\n        从以下交互中提取关键事实和偏好：\n        用户：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>raw_interaction<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>user_message<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n        助手：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>raw_interaction<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>assistant_message<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n        \n        提取：\n        1. 明确的事实（用户说了什么）\n        2. 隐含偏好（用户喜欢/不喜欢什么）\n        3. 待办事项（用户要求做什么）\n        4. 重要性评分（1-10）\n        \"\"\"</span></span>\n        extracted <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>extract<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>extraction_prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> MemoryEntry<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            content<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>extracted<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>facts<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            memory_type<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>classify_memory_type<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>extracted<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            importance<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>extracted<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>importance<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            timestamp<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>raw_interaction<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>timestamp<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            source_interaction_id<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>raw_interaction<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># ===== 2. 存储 (Store) =====</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">store</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> MemoryEntry<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"分层存储记忆\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># L1: 总是写入工作记忆</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>working_memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># L2: 写入短期缓存</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>short_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">set</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            key<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"mem:</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            value<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>to_json<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            ttl<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">3600</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 1小时过期</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># L3: 重要记忆异步写入长期存储</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>importance <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">6</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 向量化</span>\n            embedding <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embed<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>long_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>store<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                <span class=\"token builtin\">id</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                content<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                embedding<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                metadata<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>metadata\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># L4: 结构化知识写入图数据库</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>has_structured_knowledge<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>cognitive<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_knowledge_triple<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                subject<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>entity<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                predicate<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>relation<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token builtin\">object</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>entry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>value\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># ===== 3. 检索 (Retrieve) =====</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">retrieve</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> context<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                       top_k<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> RetrievedMemories<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"多路召回 + 精排\"\"\"</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 3.1 L1 工作记忆直接读取</span>\n        working_results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>working_memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get_recent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>k<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 3.2 L2 短期缓存查询</span>\n        cache_results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>short_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>search<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 3.3 L3 长期记忆向量检索</span>\n        query_embedding <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embed<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        vector_results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>long_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>similarity_search<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            embedding<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>query_embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            k<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>top_k <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 多召回一些用于重排</span>\n            <span class=\"token builtin\">filter</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"user_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> context<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>user_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 3.4 多路结果融合 + Rerank</span>\n        all_candidates <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>merge_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            working_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> cache_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> vector_results\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        ranked <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>rerank<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> all_candidates<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 3.5 上下文窗口适配</span>\n        selected <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>fit_to_context_window<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>ranked<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_tokens<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">2000</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> RetrievedMemories<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>selected<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># ===== 4. 巩固 (Consolidation) =====</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">consolidate</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> session<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Session<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"会话结束后，将短期记忆巩固为长期记忆\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 生成会话摘要</span>\n        summary <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>summarize<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            session<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get_full_history<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 提取关键事实</span>\n        key_facts <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>extract_facts<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>summary<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 更新用户画像</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> fact <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> key_facts<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>long_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>update_user_profile<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                user_id<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>session<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>user_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                fact<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>fact\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 清理短期缓存</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>short_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>clear_session<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>session<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># ===== 5. 遗忘 (Forgetting) =====</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">forget</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> policy<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> ForgettingPolicy<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"智能遗忘策略\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 时间衰减：旧记忆降低权重</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>long_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>apply_time_decay<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>half_life_days<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">30</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 冲突检测：新旧记忆冲突时保留高可信度</span>\n        conflicts <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>long_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>find_conflicts<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> conflict <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> conflicts<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            winner <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>resolve_conflict<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>conflict<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>long_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>update<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>conflict<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>old<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> winner<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 低价值记忆清理</span>\n        low_value <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>long_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>find_low_importance<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>threshold<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">0.3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> mem <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> low_value<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>long_term<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>archive<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>mem<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 归档而非删除</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>工业级记忆系统架构图：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ProductionMemoryService</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"生产级记忆服务\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 存储层</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>cache <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> RedisCluster<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>           <span class=\"token comment\"># L2 缓存</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>vector_db <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> PineconeClient<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>      <span class=\"token comment\"># L3 向量存储</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>sql_db <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> PostgreSQLPool<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>         <span class=\"token comment\"># 结构化数据</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>graph_db <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Neo4jClient<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>          <span class=\"token comment\"># L4 知识图谱</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 处理层</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embedder <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> EmbeddingService<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>     <span class=\"token comment\"># 向量化</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>reranker <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> RerankerModel<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>        <span class=\"token comment\"># 精排模型</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>consolidator <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Consolidator<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>     <span class=\"token comment\"># 巩固器</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 监控</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>metrics <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> MemoryMetrics<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>         <span class=\"token comment\"># 指标监控</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">get_memory</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> request<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> MemoryRequest<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> MemoryResponse<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"带监控的记忆获取\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">with</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>metrics<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>measure_latency<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"memory_retrieve\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 多级缓存</span>\n            result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_multi_tier_retrieve<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>request<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>metrics<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>record_hit_rate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> result\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"2. 延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">2. 延伸追问</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：记忆系统的最大瓶颈在哪里？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：通常是向量检索的 P99 延迟会吃进 TTFT（首 token 时间）。缓解方式：Redis 预热、浅层偏好预载、异步精排。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：如何处理多用户的记忆隔离？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：①用户 ID 作为命名空间 ②检索时加 user_id filter ③多租户向量数据库（如 Pinecone 的 namespace）</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-heading=\"3. 常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">3. 常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：向量数据库是唯一选择</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：Claude Code 的实践表明，文件索引 + 按需加载的简单方案在很多场景下工作得很好。选择技术要匹配实际需求</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"4. 相关\" dir=\"auto\">4. 相关</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a> — 返回主题导航</li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}